    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game transports you to a world brimming with retro charm, featuring classic pixel art that is vibrant and rich in detail, inviting exploration around every corner. The background music is upbeat and rhythmic, complemented by ambient sounds like the rustling of leaves and chirping birds, creating an atmosphere of tranquil serenity. Players take on the role of a miniature soldier character, embarking on adventures in a primitive town. At the start of the game, players receive an initial fund to purchase essential supplies such as food, ammunition, and medical kits, preparing for the journey ahead. Using the A and D keys to move your character, you must explore this uncharted world, seeking clues, solving puzzles, and interacting with NPCs to gather information, all while being cautious of lurking foes. It is not only an expedition into the unknown but also a journey of the soul.</p>",
